      "issue": "The node claims 'Standard pre-maintenance steps were followed' but cites a source (24ec1587...) that only records the crew collecting equipment and being at the gallery. It does not establish what specific configuration checks or valve status confirmations occurred before 09:48.",
      "evidenceNeeded": "A record explicitly stating which system configuration check was performed, when it was completed, and its result (pass/fail) prior to starting work.","question":"What specific verification of the compressor/dryer system state (valve positions, isolation status) occurred between 09:35 collection and 09:48 gallery arrival?"
